{"title": "Tape Drive Comparisons: Tape vs. Disk vs. Cloud - TapeBackup.org", "html": "<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center mb-12\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6\">Tape vs. Disk vs. Cloud: Backup Comparisons</h1><p class=\"text-xl text-muted-foreground\">Comprehensive comparison of LTO tape, disk storage, and cloud solutions to help you make informed decisions.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-2xl\">LTO Tape vs Disk vs Cloud</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b-2 border-border\"><th class=\"text-left p-4 font-semibold\">Feature</th><th class=\"text-center p-4 font-semibold bg-primary/5\">LTO Tape</th><th class=\"text-center p-4 font-semibold\">Disk Storage</th><th class=\"text-center p-4 font-semibold\">Cloud Storage</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-border hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"p-4 font-medium\">Cost per TB (10 years)</td><td class=\"p-4 text-center bg-primary/5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-accent font-semibold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4 text-accent\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>$5-10</span></div></td><td class=\"p-4 text-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground\"><span>$15-30</span></div></td><td class=\"p-4 text-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground\"><span>$200-500+</span></div></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"p-4 font-medium\">Initial Investment</td><td class=\"p-4 text-ce