th=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Geographic redundancy required</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>No on-premises infrastructure</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Remote access from anywhere</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Disaster recovery scenarios</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Collaboration and sharing needs</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Scalability without hardware purchase</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-2 border-primary\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Recommended: Hybrid Approach</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"mb-4 text-muted-foreground\">Most enterprises benefit from combining all three technologies in a tiered architecture:</p><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-primary\">Tier 1:</span><span>Disk for fast recovery (30-90 days)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-secondary\">Tier 2:</span><span>Cloud for offsite replication</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-accent\">Tier 3:</span><span>Tape for long-term archive + air gap</span></li></ul><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">This approach optimizes for cost, performance, and security while providing comprehensive data protection.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-2 border-dashed\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Interactive Cost Calculator</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"text-center py-8\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground mb-4\">Calculate your storage costs across different solutions</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Coming soon: Input your storage requirements and compare TCO across tape, disk, and cloud over time.</p></div></div></div></div>"}